# Lobby de la Liga (lobby: healing center, shop, PC and the way in, C9, contract 56), 13 x 10, interior. column = i, row = j. The nurse (heals and REMEMBERS this lobby as the respawn point), the PC (the box and, once the
# hero is the champion, the Hall of Legacy), the clerk (`shop meseta_cumbre`) and the way to the first room: the doorway (6,0) behind the LEAGUE DOOR (6,1), a solid gate NPC with a badge reader: talking to it checks the EIGHT badges (80 .. 87); with
# all of them it opens for good (flag liga_checked). The doorway is `@warp ... oneway` into liga_hielo (the first room shuts the door behind the hero, contract 50.2). Big light marble slabs under everything.
@map liga_lobby
@size 13 10
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill marb_00
@spawn door 6 8 N
@flag liga_checked 905                 # the badge reader opened the League door (the eight badges were checked)
@legend
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  0  tile=marb_00 
  1  tile=marb_11 object=bookshelf interact=look text=lb.books
  2  tile=marb_01 object=healer
  3  tile=marb_11 npc=nurse id=nurse face=SW script=nurse
  4  tile=marb_01 
  5  tile=marb_11 
  6  tile=marb_01 npc=keydoor id=door face=S solid=yes gate=yes script=liga_door hide_flag=liga_checked
  7  tile=marb_11 npc=tendero id=clerk face=SW script=clerk
  8  tile=marb_11 object=pc interact=look script=pc_box
  9  tile=marb_10 
  a  tile=marb_00 object=counter
  b  tile=marb_10 object=counter
  c  tile=marb_00 
  d  tile=marb_11 object=shelf
  e  tile=marb_10 npc=vecino_m id=coach face=NE text=lb.coach
  f  tile=mat
  g  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwwyww0wwywww
  |123456547484
  |9aba9c9aba9c
  |5454545454d4
  q9c9c9c9c9c9c
  |545454545454
  |9cec9c9c9c9c
  |545454545454
  |9c9c9c9c9c9c
  |54545fg45454
@warp 0 -> liga_hielo spawn=in oneway
@warp f -> meseta_cumbre spawn=lobby_door
@warp g -> meseta_cumbre spawn=lobby_door
# This lobby is where a blackout in the League sends the hero back to (the Centro rule, contract 50): entering it remembers it; the nurse does the same after healing.
@script lobby on_enter
    respawn door
@end
@script nurse npc
    ask gl.center.ask
    jv 0 1 yes
    say gl.center.bye
    end
  yes:
    fade_out
    wait 1500
    heal_party
    respawn door
    fade_in
    say gl.center.done
@end
@script pc_box interact
    pc
@end
@script clerk npc
    shop meseta_cumbre
@end
# The League door (here at the way in): all eight badges (80 .. 87: Cantera, Marea, Voltio, Raiz, Toxina, Mente, Brasa, Nucleo) open it for good.
@script liga_door npc
    jnf badge_cantera lacking
    jnf badge_marea lacking
    jnf badge_voltio lacking
    jnf badge_raiz lacking
    jnf badge_toxina lacking
    jnf badge_mente lacking
    jnf 86 lacking
    jnf badge_nucleo lacking
    sfx door
    setf liga_checked
    npc_hide door
    say lb.door.ok
    end
  lacking:
    say lb.door.no
@end
